a href=\"#/wiki/Farmine\">Farmine</a> ?</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Fibula\">Fibula</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Gray%20Beach\">Gray Beach</a> ?</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Hellgate\">Hellgate</a> entrance</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Kazordoon\">Kazordoon</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32627,31918,1\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32627, 31918, 1)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Liberty%20Bay\">Liberty Bay</a> ?</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Mintwallin\">Mintwallin</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Rookgaard\">Rookgaard</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a>, (on Mill Avenue next to <a href=\"#/wiki/Grof%2C%20The%20Guard\">Grof, The Guard</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Venore\">Venore</a></li></ul>\n<p>And possibly other places.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Primitive machine found in many different places. Used to crush Bunches of Wheat into <a href=\"#/wiki/Flour\">Flour</a>. Usually attached to a <a href=\"#/wiki/Water%20Wheel\">Water Wheel</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bread\">Bread</a></li><li>Bunch of Reed</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bunch%20of%20Wheat\">Bunch of Wheat</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cake\">Cake</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cake%20%28Decorated%29\">Cake (Decorated)</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cake%20Keep%20Isle\">Cake Keep Isle</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Chocolate%20Cake\">Chocolate Cake</a></li><li>Cooking</li><li>Flooring</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Flour\">Flour</a></li><li>Functional Objects</li><li>Grass</li><li>Ground Reed</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/hot-cuisine-quest\">Hot Cuisine Ques